"A retro-inspired fixed-screen shooter. The player controls a mobile defense cannon moving horizontally along the bottom of the screen. Core mechanics involve firing projectiles upward to destroy rows of descending alien invaders while strategically using four destructible energy barriers for cover. The visual style features high-contrast neon pixel art against a dark void. Enemies move in a synchronized grid, shifting downward and increasing speed as their numbers dwindle. Random 'mystery ships' fly across the top for bonus points. The win condition is achieved by eliminating all enemy waves before any invader reaches the player's baseline or the player's lives are exhausted."